From 0190000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TEX8 Patch Integrator <patches@tex8.local>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 19:10:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 19/19] Add reproducible Metal key derivation testbench

Add isolated C/Ref10, Rust/Dalek, and Apple Metal testbenches for the exact
Monero D = 8*a*R operation. The Metal M12 candidate uses a 10-limb 25/26-bit
field representation plus chunked Montgomery batch inversion; M16 adds
pass-specific dispatch sizing without changing the kernel mathematics. Every
GPU run is checked byte-for-byte against deterministic Dalek vectors and
preserves the invalid-point contract. No product path or wallet key handling
is enabled.
---
